    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n21216" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βυλλά:</span></b> 
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βεβυσμένα</span>, <i><span class="en">
			Hsch.
		</span></i>:—hence <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βυλλόω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>stuff</i>,
