			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῥαχίδες</span>, Id. <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βυνεύς:</span></b> 
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σκεύασμά τι κρίθινον</span>, Id.</div>
